    "termsOfAccess": "This interview is for scholarly use only. Parts of this interview can be found on the Croation Memories website, these are freely accessible.\n \nThis interview is part of the CroMe (Croation Memories) project. The CroMe project is financed by the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs under the Matra funding scheme. This fund aims to improve the development of societies of counties that are candidates for accession to the EU. Special interest of Matra is stimulating the development of a civil society. Local organizations work together with organizations from the Netherlands to improve knowledge in the specific fields.",
